# Proofreading Sample

## Demonstration Sample

*This is an original demonstration sample created to showcase my proofreading skills. It is not taken from a client project.*

### Before Proofreading

The meeting was held on monday morning and everyone were expected to arrive early. However, several members arrived late because of the heavy traffic. The manager welcomed everyone and explained that the purpose of the meeting were to discuss the companies plans for the coming year.

### After Proofreading

The meeting was held on Monday morning, and everyone was expected to arrive early. However, several members arrived late because of the heavy traffic. The manager welcomed everyone and explained that the purpose of the meeting was to discuss the company's plans for the coming year.

### What I Corrected

- Grammar and subject-verb agreement
- Capitalization
- Punctuation
- Apostrophe usage
- Sentence accuracy and consistency

### My Proofreading Approach

I carefully review written content for grammar, spelling, punctuation, capitalization, consistency, and other surface-level errors while preserving the writer's original meaning and voice.
